  "details": "Maybe not in large, 20-80 person public instances, but the headsets, especially the Frame are absolutely more than capable of running the PC version of VRC. Smaller group hangouts of 10 people or less, which is a massively common usage of the platform especially amongst friends, would certainly be able to run on the Frame. It may lead to individual issues if the user pushes it, but it should be an option nonetheless, just with a warning that it's a less compatible version.",
